WEBVTT

1
00:00:11.760 --> 00:00:15.788
Hier, j'ai visité le vieux port.
Yesterday I visited the old harbour.

2
00:00:15.888 --> 00:00:18.404
Tu as mangé où ?
Where did you eat?

3
00:00:18.504 --> 00:00:24.452
J'ai mangé dans un petit restaurant. Puis on a pris le train.
I ate in a small restaurant. Then we took the train.

4
00:00:24.552 --> 00:00:27.428
Vous avez vu la plage ?
Did you see the beach?

5
00:00:27.528 --> 00:00:33.164
Oui, mais je n'ai pas nagé. L'eau était froide.
Yes, but I didn't swim. The water was cold.

6
00:00:33.264 --> 00:00:36.332
Tu as aimé ton voyage ?
Did you like your trip?

7
00:00:36.432 --> 00:00:39.116
J'ai adoré !
I loved it!
